-- CK-193: a `foreign` value of a record type with 65 fields, the last of
-- them a type variable, is as polymorphic as `foreign anything : a` and must
-- be refused (`boundary.md` §4, check 1). At 31dd4bd the shape check walked
-- the type on a 64-slot stack and answered "concrete" when it filled, so the
-- build exited 0. Oracle twin: the same record with three fields is refused.
import Bad
import Prog exposing (Program)


main : Program
main =
    Prog.say Bad.wide.g
